# ABP Module Solution Template

For creating reusable ABP modules.

## Solution Structure
```
MyModule/
├── src/
│   ├── MyModule.Domain.Shared
│   ├── MyModule.Domain
│   ├── MyModule.Application.Contracts
│   ├── MyModule.Application
│   ├── MyModule.EntityFrameworkCore
│   ├── MyModule.MongoDB
│   ├── MyModule.HttpApi
│   ├── MyModule.HttpApi.Client
│   ├── MyModule.Web
│   └── MyModule.Blazor
└── test/
    └── MyModule.Tests
```

## Key Considerations

### Database Independence
- Support both EF Core and MongoDB
- Use repository pattern
- Don't expose IQueryable publicly

### Module Configuration
```csharp
Configure<MyModuleOptions>(options =>
{
    options.SomeSetting = value;
});
```

### Table Prefix
```csharp
public static class MyModuleDbProperties
{
    public static string DbTablePrefix { get; set; } = "MyModule";
    public static string DbSchema { get; set; } = null;
}
```

### Extensibility
- Virtual methods
- Options classes
- Extension points
